<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Centralized Reporting — AI Centric Testing</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0f1117; --panel:#141824; --panel2:#181e2e; --line:#232a3b; --line2:#2d3748;
  --ink:#e8eaf2; --dim:#8b93a8; --dimmer:#5b6274;
  --pass:#22c55e; --pass-bg:#0a2e18;
  --fail:#ef4444; --fail-bg:#450a0a;
  --skip:#9ca3af; --skip-bg:#1f2937;
  --lain:#f59e0b; --lain-bg:#331c04;
  --info:#3b82f6; --info-bg:#0d1f38;
  --cyan:#0ea5e9; --cyan-bg:#123047;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.header{height:44px;flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:0 16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1f2e,#1e2640);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.header .logo{font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;font-size:.8rem}
.header .logo span{color:#a78bfa}
.header .sub{font-size:.6rem;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase}
.header .right{margin-left:auto}
.chip{font-size:.58rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:10px;
  border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--dim);background:var(--panel2)}
.chip.live{color:var(--pass);border-color:#14532d;background:var(--pass-bg)}
.main{flex:1;display:flex;min-height:0}
/* sidebar */
.side{width:210px;flex:none;background:var(--panel);border-right:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:12px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.side .stitle{font-size:.56rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:var(--dimmer);
  padding:6px 10px 4px}
.sitem{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;
  color:var(--dim);border-left:3px solid transparent}
.sitem:hover{background:var(--panel2)}
.sitem.on{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--ink)}
.sitem .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
.sitem .nm{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.4px}
.sitem .full{font-size:.56rem;color:var(--dimmer);display:block;margin-top:1px}
/* content */
.content{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:12px;gap:10px;overflow:hidden}
.pbthead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.pbthead h1{font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.6px}
.pbthead .meta{font-size:.64rem;color:var(--dim)}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:0}
.tab{padding:7px 16px;font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:var(--dim);
  cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;border-bottom:none;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0}
.tab.on{color:var(--ink);background:var(--panel);border-color:var(--line)}
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0 9px 9px 9px;
  flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
/* stat tiles */
.tiles{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 12px 4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tile{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 16px;text-align:center;min-width:86px}
.tile .n{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tile .l{font-size:.54rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--dimmer);margin-top:2px}
/* filter row */
.filters{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:8px 12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fchip{font-size:.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:11px;
  border:1px solid var(--line2);color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;background:transparent}
.fchip.on{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--dim)}
.fchip .k{opacity:.7;margin-left:4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.search{margin-left:auto;background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--ink);padding:5px 10px;font-size:.68rem;width:180px;outline:none}
/* table */
.scroll{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;min-height:0;padding:0 12px 12px}
.scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{width:8px}
.scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line2);border-radius:4px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
th{font-size:.56rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:var(--dimmer);text-align:left;
  padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--panel)}
td{padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(35,42,59,.55);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--dim);vertical-align:top}
td.tc{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
.badge{font-size:.56rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap}
/* history */
.run{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-left:3px solid var(--dim);border-radius:8px;margin:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--panel2)}
.run:hover{background:#1c2336}
.run.on{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.5px #f59e0b}
.run .when{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
.run .info{font-size:.62rem;color:var(--dim)}
.run .bar{flex:1;height:9px;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.run .bar i{height:100%}
.run .counts{font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:.62rem;color:var(--dim);white-space:nowrap}
.empty{color:var(--dimmer);font-size:.72rem;padding:24px;text-align:center}
/* tutorials */
.tut{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:14px 18px}
.tut h2{font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:var(--cyan);margin:18px 0 8px}
.tut h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
.tut p, .tut li{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.6}
.tut ol,.tut ul{padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0}
.tut .step{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:8px;
  background:var(--panel2);padding:10px 12px;margin:8px 0}
.cmd{position:relative;background:#0b0e15;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:8px;
  padding:9px 40px 9px 12px;margin:6px 0;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:.66rem;color:#a5f3a5;
  white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}
.copy{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line2);
  background:var(--panel2);color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer;font-size:.7rem;line-height:1}
.copy:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--dim)}
.copy.ok{color:var(--pass);border-color:var(--pass)}
.note{font-size:.64rem;color:var(--lain);background:var(--lain-bg);border:1px solid #713f12;
  border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;margin:6px 0}

/* --- animasi ilustrasi manual --- */
@keyframes apung{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-5px)}}
@keyframes apung2{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}
@keyframes kelip{0%,49%{opacity:1}50%,100%{opacity:0}}
@keyframes denyut{0%,100%{opacity:.15}50%{opacity:.9}}
@keyframes cetak{0%{transform:translateY(-26px)}70%{transform:translateY(0)}100%{transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes led{0%,100%{opacity:.3}50%{opacity:1}}
.il-a1{animation:apung 4s ease-in-out infinite}
.il-a2{animation:apung2 4.6s ease-in-out .6s infinite}
.il-a3{animation:apung 5s ease-in-out 1.1s infinite}
.il-kelip{animation:kelip 1.1s steps(1) infinite}
.il-bt1{animation:denyut 2s ease-in-out infinite}
.il-bt2{animation:denyut 2s ease-in-out .4s infinite}
.il-cetak{animation:cetak 3.2s ease-in-out infinite}
.il-led{animation:led 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <div class="logo">CENTRALIZED REPORTING <span>◉</span></div>
  <div class="sub">AI Centric Testing · Semua PBT</div>
  <div class="right" style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><span class="chip" id="langsw" onclick="toggleLang()" style="cursor:pointer;user-select:none" title="Bahasa / Language">BM | EN</span><span class="chip live" id="feed">LIVE</span></div>
</div>
<div class="main">
  <div class="side" id="side">
    <div class="stitle">PBT</div>
    <div id="sidePbt"></div>
    <div class="stitle" style="margin-top:8px">Rujukan</div>
    <div class="sitem" data-pbt="TUTORIALS" onclick="pick('TUTORIALS')">
      <span class="dot" style="background:#a78bfa"></span>
      <span><span class="nm">TUTORIALS</span><span class="full">proses kerja &amp; command</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="content" id="content"></div>
</div>

<script>
let LANG=(()=>{try{return localStorage.getItem('lang')||'EN'}catch(e){return 'EN'}})();
function tr(bm,en){return LANG==='EN'?en:bm;}
function toggleLang(){LANG=LANG==='BM'?'EN':'BM';try{localStorage.setItem('lang',LANG)}catch(e){};render();}
const ST = {
  PASSED:{c:'var(--pass)',bg:'var(--pass-bg)',label:'PASSED'},
  FAILED:{c:'var(--fail)',bg:'var(--fail-bg)',label:'FAILED'},
  ERROR:{c:'var(--fail)',bg:'var(--fail-bg)',label:'ERROR'},
  SKIPPED:{c:'var(--skip)',bg:'var(--skip-bg)',label:'SKIPPED'},
  NO_EVIDENCE:{c:'var(--lain)',bg:'var(--lain-bg)',label:'TIADA BUKTI'},
  NEEDS_EYE:{c:'var(--lain)',bg:'var(--lain-bg)',label:'PERLU MATA'},
  NOT_RUN:{c:'var(--dimmer)',bg:'var(--skip-bg)',label:'NOT RUN'},
};
function stMeta(s){ return ST[s] || {c:'var(--dim)',bg:'var(--skip-bg)',label:s}; }

let DATA={manifest:{pbt:[]},runs:{}};
let sel={pbt:null,tab:'laporan',run:0,filter:'SEMUA',q:''};

async function refresh(){
  try{
    const r=await fetch('/api/data',{cache:'no-store'});
    DATA=await r.json();
    document.getElementById('feed').textContent='LIVE';
    document.getElementById('feed').classList.add('live');
    if(!sel.pbt && DATA.manifest.pbt.length) sel.pbt=DATA.manifest.pbt[0].kod;
  }catch(e){
    document.getElementById('feed').textContent='OFFLINE';
    document.getElementById('feed').classList.remove('live');
  }
  render();
}
setInterval(refresh,5000); refresh();

function pick(kod){ sel.pbt=kod; sel.tab= kod==='TUTORIALS'?'tut':'laporan'; sel.run=0; sel.filter='SEMUA'; sel.q=''; render(); }
function pickTab(t){ sel.tab=t; render(); }
let mstep=0;
function pickStep(i){ mstep=i; render(); }
function pickRun(i){ sel.run=i; sel.tab='laporan'; render(); }
function pickFilter(f){ sel.filter=f; render(); }

function render(){
  const lsw=document.getElementById('langsw');
  if(lsw) lsw.innerHTML= LANG==='BM'?'<b style="color:var(--ink)">BM</b> · EN':'BM · <b style="color:var(--ink)">EN</b>';
  renderSide();
  const c=document.getElementById('content');
  if(sel.pbt==='TUTORIALS'){ c.innerHTML=tutHtml(); return; }
  const runs=DATA.runs[sel.pbt]||[];
  const run=runs[sel.run];
  const p=(DATA.manifest.pbt||[]).find(x=>x.kod===sel.pbt)||{};
  let h=`<div class="pbthead"><h1 style="color:${p.warna||'var(--ink)'}">${sel.pbt}</h1>
    <span class="meta">${p.nama||''}</span>
    ${run?`<span class="meta">v${run.app_version||'?'} · ${run.env||''} · ${run.device_model||''} · ${fmtDT(run.generated_at)} · ${fmtDur(run.duration_seconds)} · tester ${run.tester||'?'}</span>`:''}
  </div>
  <div class="tabs">
    <div class="tab ${sel.tab==='laporan'?'on':''}" onclick="pickTab('laporan')">${tr('Laporan','Report')}</div>
    <div class="tab ${sel.tab==='sejarah'?'on':''}" onclick="pickTab('sejarah')">${tr('Sejarah Run','Run History')} (${runs.length})</div>
    <div class="tab ${sel.tab==='ganti'?'on':''}" onclick="pickTab('ganti')">${tr('Ganti Nilai','Replace Values')}</div>
    <div class="tab ${sel.tab==='manual'?'on':''}" onclick="pickTab('manual')">Manual User</div>
  </div>`;
  if(sel.tab==='laporan') h+=laporanHtml(run);
  else if(sel.tab==='sejarah') h+=sejarahHtml(runs);
  else if(sel.tab==='ganti') h+=`<div class="panel"><div class="tut" id="gantiWrap"><div class="empty">${tr('memuat...','loading...')}</div></div></div>`;
  else h+=manualHtml(sel.pbt);
  c.innerHTML=h;
  const s=document.getElementById('search');
  if(s){ s.value=sel.q; s.oninput=e=>{sel.q=e.target.value; renderTableOnly(run);} }
  if(sel.tab==='ganti') renderGanti();
}

function renderSide(){
  const el=document.getElementById('sidePbt');
  el.innerHTML=(DATA.manifest.pbt||[]).map(p=>{
    const runs=DATA.runs[p.kod]||[]; const last=runs[0];
    const sum=last?last.summary:null;
    return `<div class="sitem ${sel.pbt===p.kod?'on':''}" style="border-left-color:${sel.pbt===p.kod?p.warna:'transparent'}" onclick="pick('${p.kod}')">
      <span class="dot" style="background:${p.warna}"></span>
      <span><span class="nm">${p.kod}</span>
      <span class="full">${sum?`P${sum.passed} F${sum.failed} S${sum.skipped}`:'tiada larian'}</span></span>
    </div>`;
  }).join('');
  document.querySelector('[data-pbt=TUTORIALS]').classList.toggle('on', sel.pbt==='TUTORIALS');
}

function counts(run){
  const k={SEMUA:0,PASSED:0,FAILED:0,SKIPPED:0,LAIN:0};
  if(!run) return k;
  for(const v of Object.values(run.results)){ k.SEMUA++;
    if(v.status==='PASSED')k.PASSED++;
    else if(v.status==='FAILED'||v.status==='ERROR')k.FAILED++;
    else if(v.status==='SKIPPED')k.SKIPPED++;
    else k.LAIN++;
  } return k;
}
function inFilter(v){
  if(sel.filter==='SEMUA') return true;
  if(sel.filter==='PASSED') return v.status==='PASSED';
  if(sel.filter==='FAILED') return v.status==='FAILED'||v.status==='ERROR';
  if(sel.filter==='SKIPPED') return v.status==='SKIPPED';
  return !['PASSED','FAILED','ERROR','SKIPPED'].includes(v.status);
}

function laporanHtml(run){
  if(!run) return `<div class="panel"><div class="empty">${tr('Tiada larian untuk PBT ini lagi','No runs for this PBT yet')}</div></div>`;
  const k=counts(run);
  return `<div class="panel">
    <div class="tiles">
      <div class="tile"><div class="n">${k.SEMUA}</div><div class="l">${tr('jumlah tc','total tc')}</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="n" style="color:var(--pass)">${k.PASSED}</div><div class="l">passed</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="n" style="color:var(--fail)">${k.FAILED}</div><div class="l">failed</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="n" style="color:var(--skip)">${k.SKIPPED}</div><div class="l">skipped</div></div>
      <div class="tile"><div class="n" style="color:var(--lain)">${k.LAIN}</div><div class="l">${tr('lain','other')}</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="filters">
      ${['SEMUA','PASSED','FAILED','SKIPPED','LAIN'].map(f=>
        `<span class="fchip ${sel.filter===f?'on':''}" onclick="pickFilter('${f}')">${f==='SEMUA'?tr('SEMUA','ALL'):f==='LAIN'?tr('LAIN','OTHER'):f}<span class="k">${k[f]??''}</span></span>`).join('')}
      <input class="search" id="search" placeholder="${tr('cari TC / sebab...','search TC / reason...')}">
    </div>
    <div class="scroll" id="tbl">${tableHtml(run)}</div>
  </div>`;
}
function renderTableOnly(run){ const t=document.getElementById('tbl'); if(t&&run) t.innerHTML=tableHtml(run); }
function tableHtml(run){
  const q=sel.q.toLowerCase();
  const rows=Object.entries(run.results)
    .filter(([tc,v])=>inFilter(v))
    .filter(([tc,v])=>!q || tc.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||
      (v.nama||'').toLowerCase().includes(q) || (v.sebab||'').toLowerCase().includes(q));
  if(!rows.length) return `<div class="empty">${tr('Tiada TC padan dengan penapis','No TC matches the filter')}</div>`;
  return `<table><thead><tr><th style="width:130px">TC</th><th style="width:210px">${tr('Nama','Name')}</th>
    <th style="width:110px">Status</th><th>${tr('Sebab / bukti','Reason / evidence')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    ${rows.map(([tc,v])=>{const m=stMeta(v.status);
      return `<tr><td class="tc">${tc}</td><td>${esc(v.nama||'—')}</td>
      <td><span class="badge" style="color:${m.c};background:${m.bg};border-color:${m.c}55">${m.label}</span></td>
      <td>${esc(v.sebab||'—')}</td></tr>`;}).join('')}
  </tbody></table>`;
}

function sejarahHtml(runs){
  if(!runs.length) return `<div class="panel"><div class="empty">Tiada sejarah larian</div></div>`;
  return `<div class="panel"><div class="scroll">
    ${runs.map((r,i)=>{const s=r.summary; const tot=Math.max(1,s.passed+s.failed+s.skipped+s.lain);
      return `<div class="run ${sel.run===i?'on':''}" onclick="pickRun(${i})">
      <span class="when">${fmtDT(r.generated_at)}</span>
      <span class="info">v${r.app_version||'?'} · ${r.env||''} · ${r.tester||'?'} · ${fmtDur(r.duration_seconds)}</span>
      <span class="bar">
        <i style="width:${100*s.passed/tot}%;background:var(--pass)"></i>
        <i style="width:${100*s.failed/tot}%;background:var(--fail)"></i>
        <i style="width:${100*s.skipped/tot}%;background:var(--skip)"></i>
        <i style="width:${100*s.lain/tot}%;background:var(--lain)"></i>
      </span>
      <span class="counts">P${s.passed} F${s.failed} S${s.skipped} L${s.lain}</span>
    </div>`;}).join('')}
  </div></div>`;
}

/* ---------------- TUTORIALS ---------------- */
function cmd(text){ return `<div class="cmd">${esc(text)}<button class="copy" onclick="doCopy(this)" title="salin">⧉</button></div>`; }
function doCopy(btn){
  const text=btn.parentElement.childNodes[0].textContent;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{ btn.classList.add('ok'); btn.textContent='✓';
    setTimeout(()=>{btn.classList.remove('ok'); btn.textContent='⧉';},1200); });
}
function tutHtml(){
  return `<div class="pbthead"><h1 style="color:#a78bfa">TUTORIALS</h1>
    <span class="meta">proses kerja lengkap — pasang, sedia, larian, baca hasil</span></div>
  <div class="panel" style="border-radius:9px"><div class="tut">

  <h2>Proses kerja</h2>
  <p>1 Pasang alat (sekali sahaja) → 2 Sambung peranti &amp; printer → 3 Buka Appium (terminal 1) →
  4 cd ke folder PBT &amp; jalankan runner (terminal 2) → 5 Baca laporan. Satu larian penuh: MBPG 35-50 minit; MBIP/MBJB 1.5-2.5 jam.</p>

  <h2>1 · Pasang Appium &amp; alat (sekali sahaja)</h2>
  <div class="step"><p>Pasang dahulu: <b>Node.js</b> (nodejs.org, versi LTS), <b>Python 3.11+</b> (python.org — tandakan "Add Python to PATH"), <b>adb</b> (Android platform-tools, unzip, tambah ke PATH). Kemudian:</p>
  ${cmd('npm install -g appium')}
  ${cmd('appium driver install uiautomator2')}
  ${cmd('pip install -r requirements.txt')}
  <p>Semak semuanya berfungsi:</p>
  ${cmd('node -v && python --version && adb version && appium -v')}</div>

  <h2>2 · Sedia peranti &amp; printer</h2>
  <div class="step"><ul>
  <li>Telefon (Ulefone Armor 27): <b>USB debugging ON</b> (Settings → Developer options), APK PBT dipasang, auto-lock OFF, kekal bersambung USB sepanjang larian.</li>
  <li>Printer <b>Bixolon SPP-R410</b>: hidupkan &amp; pastikan berpasangan Bluetooth dengan telefon SEBELUM larian. Tanpa printer: tambah <b>--tanpa-printer</b> (TC cetak jadi SKIP).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Sahkan peranti dikesan (mesti nampak serial, bukan kosong):</p>
  ${cmd('adb devices')}
  <p>Kalau peranti "offline" atau hilang tengah larian (USB tercabut):</p>
  ${cmd('adb reconnect offline')}</div>

  <h2>3 · Buka Appium — Terminal 1</h2>
  <div class="step">${cmd('appium')}
  <p>Biarkan terminal ini terbuka sepanjang larian.</p></div>

  <h2>4 · Larian — Terminal 2 (pilih PBT)</h2>
  <div class="step"><p><b>MBPG</b> (production — mod sebenar, minta kelulusan pra-larian dahulu):</p>
  ${cmd('cd C:\\Users\\mrsai\\Documents\\antigravity\\keen-lovelace\\MBPG-testing')}
  ${cmd('$env:MBPG_IZIN_PRODUCTION = "1"')}
  ${cmd('python tools\\run_penuh.py --borang NPK')}
  <p>Skrip akan tanya IP server dan nombor lesen — tekan Enter untuk terima nilai profil, kemudian taip YA.</p>
  <p>Pilihan berguna: <b>--borang N</b> (satu borang), <b>--langkau-selaras</b>, <b>--tanpa-printer</b>, <b>--ip x --lesen y</b> (tanpa prompt).</p></div>
  <div class="step"><p><b>MBJB</b>:</p>
  ${cmd('cd C:\\Users\\mrsai\\Documents\\antigravity\\keen-lovelace\\mbjb-testing')}
  ${cmd('python tools\\run_and_report.py')}</div>
  <div class="step"><p><b>MBIP</b> (suite v3 / dashboard):</p>
